<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Affordable Bike Transportation in Ranchi | Lowest Rate Guarantee
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required to book affordable bike transportation in Ranchi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To book a bike parcel with Shree Ashirwad, you need a valid government‑issued ID, the bike’s registration certificate, a signed IBA‑approved invoice, and a copy of your GST registration if applicable. These documents ensure smooth customs clearance, insurance activation, and transparent billing.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the zero‑scratch guarantee work during long‑distance transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by hydraulic ramp trailers and sealed multi‑axle containers. Each bike undergoes a pre‑load inspection, is secured with custom wooden cradles, and is monitored via live GPS. If any damage occurs, we cover repair costs and provide a full refund of the transport fee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike parcel from Ranchi to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is equipped with a satellite‑enabled GPS tracker linked to our 24/7 control center. You receive a real‑time tracking link via SMS or email, allowing you to monitor the bike’s exact location, estimated arrival time, and any transit updates.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is bike transport through bus or train cheaper than road freight?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While bus and train parcels can be cost‑effective for certain routes, they often lack door‑to‑door service, dedicated handling, and the zero‑scratch guarantee. Our road freight combines affordable rates, specialized hydraulic ramps, and full insurance, delivering greater value and peace of mind for Ranchi customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the insurance coverage calculated for my bike during transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100% IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance based on the declared market value of your bike. The premium is calculated as a small percentage of this value and is included in the final invoice. In the unlikely event of loss or damage, the insurer reimburses the full declared amount.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical delivery time for an 850 km bike shipment from Ranchi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Standard transit time for the 850 km corridor via national highways is 2‑3 business days, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Our live tracking and proactive communication keep you informed, and we strive to meet or beat the estimated delivery window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the price‑matched quote guarantee protect me from higher rates elsewhere?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">If you find a lower legitimate quote from a verified mover for the same service scope, we will match that price and provide an additional 5% discount. This guarantee is backed by our transparent rate card and fuel audit, ensuring you always receive the most affordable bike transportation in Ranchi.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
